Package: bifrost
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 4.0), ffmpeg, socat, python3, avahi-daemon, avahi-utils
Recommends: mediamtx
Maintainer: BIFROST Project
Description: Classroom screen broadcasting server (Bash)
 BIFROST streams the teacher's desktop to student browsers on the
 local network via MJPEG and WebRTC. Zero-configuration, works on
 all Linux distributions.
 .
 Features: screen capture, audio streaming, WebRTC support,
 mDNS discovery, TUI dashboard, client tracking, Windows guard.
